WEBVTT

00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:09,640
Hello, this is Dr. Cutters, and we know that when people, it diagnosed with cancer, it becomes a very scary situation.

00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:13,320
It's not something most people are expecting, and

00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,520
it's easy to get lost in

00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:23,000
just what your doctor is telling you to do. Most people don't think, well, what should I do alternatively also?

00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,560
And I applaud you for even viewing this video because you are thinking that way.

00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:34,520
When you're diagnosed with one of the blood cancers, like lymphoma and leukemia,

00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,200
some

00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,040
tend to be known as more rapidly progressing cancers, and

00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:45,400
sometimes we need to use standards of care like chemotherapy and things.

00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,640
But how do we know what else to add to the puzzle?

00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:55,160
Because I really believe, and I think you listening to this do believe too,

00:00:55,240 --> 00:01:00,120
that if you do add alternative care to whatever else you're going to do,

00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:05,160
you can have a better outcome, and I think statistics do show that.

00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:10,120
So, what am I supposed to add from an alternative perspective?

00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,760
What specific nutrition? What supplements?

00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:17,320
Sometimes we get bombarded from well-meaning friends and loved ones.

00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:21,560
So, what to take, and what not to take, and it gets very confusing.

00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:27,400
Well, that's what we're here for you to help you walk that pathway.

00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,080
What supplement should I take? What diet should I be following?

00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:37,400
What herbal or nutrition should I be doing, and is there some equipment that can help me?

00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:40,600
We'll help walk you through this. Whether you become a patient or not,

00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:45,960
please utilize our website. Download all my books. They're all free online.

00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:54,360
Please look at that. Educate yourself. I think the more educated you are, the more empowered you are,

00:01:54,360 --> 00:02:00,200
I do believe that that is what God has called us to do, is to not be ignorant about these things

00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:06,040
as well as scriptural things. Ultimately, we want your best. We want you to have success.

00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:12,920
We want the best quality of life for you. So, no, regardless of whether you choose care

00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:22,040
in our office or not, that we will be praying for you.

